  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Ethanol undergoes dehydration by heating it with concentrated <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>443</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>443</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Alkenes on reaction with cold, dilute, aqueous solution of potassium permanganate (Baeyer&rsquo;s reagent) produce vicinal glycols. Decolorisatlon of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>KMnO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> solution is used as a test for unsaturation.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0aa6c69d-da12-4346-8706-e124386b3534-58af4e19-9b8d-48da-a0fd-5e71b7975d6f-9759244.png\" style=\"width: 451px; height: 149px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
